  "summary": "The generated code is well-structured and demonstrates solid Azure SDK management plane patterns. It correctly uses DefaultAzureCredential, async/await, for-await-of pagination, and LRO convenience methods. Key gaps: no RestError handling (only generic Error catch), no @azure/logger usage for SDK diagnostics, and uses blobServices.setServiceProperties() instead of storageAccounts.update() for the versioning step. The code quality is high with good helper functions and a cleanup pattern via try/finally.",
  "issues": [
    "No RestError import or status-code-specific error handling — only catches generic Error",
